  "bio": "Jayb is a highly skilled tattoo artist known for their impressive illustrative style that brings each design to life with impeccable detail and creativity. As the owner and tattoo artist at District36 Tattoo Parlor in Passaic, New Jersey, Jayb ensures each client's experience is matched with professionalism, from the initial consultation to the final touch of ink. To book an appointment and witness Jayb's artistry firsthand, visit them between Tuesday and Saturday from 11 am to 9 pm.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Passaic, New Jersey, United States"
